{"id": "DPS7CKgEZqA", "title": "Video by visionmachina", "description": "🚀 Last weekend was one for the books. We had the honour of creating a GenAI cinematic film for the opening of Cipta 3 concert for the legend himself, @mnasirmohamed \n\nWe only had 2 weeks to deliver and it needed to be epic and deeply rooted with his narrative.\n\nThe story we built with him was about a meteor strike, an expedition to recover the fallen stone, and its forging into a keris, a metaphor for his own journey of crafting songs and leaving a lasting legacy.\n\nTo achieve this, we began with a dedicated photoshoot for maximum character accuracy. big thanks to Fred and the VDX team for making that possible. Using our custom ComfyUI LoRA workflows, we trained a character AI model and applied our signature cinematic visual style, so even the base generations were cinema-grade and ready for the massive screen. On top of that, we pushed motion transfer for more convincing character performance, layered in cinema-level sound design, and applied just enough VFX to elevate the final impact. And to anchor it all, Dato’ M. Nasir himself recorded the voiceover, giving the film its soul.\n\nThe challenges were plenty: maintaining character consistency, getting the cinematography right, pushing believable performances, and capturing emotion through AI-driven storytelling. Each obstacle took countless iterations, but every frame brought us closer to honouring his vision.\n\nIn our conversations with him, he shared a healthy skepticism about AI, the same questions any true artist would have. We shared openly that our approach isn’t about replacing creativity, but about extending the canvas, letting AI serve the art, not overshadow it.\n\n🙏 Thank you @imantang75 and the @iconentertainmentmy team, Datuk Shahrom, Frederick Lim and team at VDX, and our rockstar Vision Machina (Luke, Kevin, Hafiz and Bimal) crew who poured their hearts into every frame.\n\n✨ A legendary night. A legendary artist. Grateful we got to be part of this journey.\n\n#VisionMachina #GenAI #MixedMedia #ConcertExperience #MNasir #Cipta3", "channel": "visionmachina", "uploader_id": "71483437226", "uploader": "VISION MACHINA", "timestamp": 1759384912, "like_count": 118, "comment_count": 7, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1864082071181657a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 83.312, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQO36EBi8y8tld20NmuWi9eoBHoSwcszNmweFc5fiSv39qsNIfkK7bUkVBizlvjKLmEx7BICfJjKdRvlSX3l3hEf.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_oc=Adovqfq_gtnsd-bR9gP2MBKXIGHdpC9CtPnwNWYbD5q8NOxa46t1QQEosIHVMcwkggEgiTs7QlTZXMZpzcTKJWPk&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=C3hmgk7SXoMQ7kNvwEUX3AS&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=2-6f4BP_ETSwtWEkafiyeQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSK9BYD_wfHHnFR9C1qnb5oO8ysaXlScGvfZP6uq7n2Hg&oe=6AF42D6B", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 83.312, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-1864082071181657a - audio only (DASH audio)"}, {"url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m367/AQOIz0dNKt6YftL6TMNX30I8TemIxdGdmxfUgwBEV3OZi-LKfANidnj7UlghJauBPULOTyMPWjLGIQ6w6v4uyL7mMzecHQ4zp3a4xeE.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Adq8Q-kJLG7xFwZc0rtqIiVYq3bToPO3XybqjLL5gFs05FmyVvSmpyddqzwxFPEG48d6MFQMESevjDfJeNPD-7UJ&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=PSFIi31aWXAQ7kNvwH33lmw&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5J